        ":question/problem": "Find the product $EF$, if\n$E=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$\nand \n$F=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & -8 & \\sqrt{5} & 14 \\\\ -2 & \\frac{7}{5} & -\\frac{\\pi }{2} & 9 \\\\ \\sqrt{17} & -6 & 0 & \\frac{e}{3} \\\\ -11 & \\sqrt{19} & -4 & -\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(3)\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n| $EF=$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |",
